{"id":"5953","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5953_main_altocumulus-cumulogenitus-and-cumulus-congestus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云单体</span>，在5500米（18000英尺）的一个小逆温暂时阻滞了其垂直发展，导致<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云顶顺风扩散</span>。这一特征可确定为积云性高积云。这个特征不是砧状云，因为它并未附着于积雨云上，而且没有纤维状结构、丝般光泽以及砧状云的白度或积雨云性密卷云的白度。</p>\n<p>之后的5分钟，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓云顶的后缘</span>在逆温上方有一定的扩散，而后单体开始消散。</p>\n<p>在水塔右侧可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">两个浓积云单体</span>，也可看到从更早的积云发展而来的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云性高积云块</span>。</p>\n<p>图中可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎</span>积云、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡</span>积云和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展</span>积云单体，以及很小块的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，维多利亚州，布罗德梅多斯","latitude":"纬度: 37° 41' 24'' S","longitude":"经度: 144° 56' 50'' E","date":"29 October 2009 1158 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 6, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.23","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.23"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5953_syn_altocumulus-cumulogenitus-and-cumulus-congestus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>南移的高压系统，西边的短波锋系</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2009，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5953_upper_altocumulus-cumulogenitus-and-cumulus-congestus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>探测显示出受到白天增温侵蚀的919 hPa小逆温，以及在5500米抑制了积云发展的逆温。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5120_main_altocumulus-cumulogenitus-altocumulus-stratifomis-translucidus-duplicatus-and-cumulus-congestus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>天空的情况很复杂：积云扩散形成了高积云；一片薄薄的高积云；还有浓云、淡云和碎云等云种的积云。</p>\n<p>最高的云是一片薄薄的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高积云</span>（透光层状云）。这种云可能是由6小时前该区域内的顶部积雨云细胞扩散而形成的。</p>\n<p>在这片云下是高积云云片，是由浓积云细胞顶部扩散而形成的。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处，强烈发展的浓云细胞的顶峰已达到一个稳定层，并开始蔓延。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>处，强烈发展但比较狭窄的浓云细胞的顶峰即将到达稳定层。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>处是一个浓云细胞的残留，其底部已消散，其顶部已<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">扩散到更大的区域</span>。</p>\n<p>还存在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎</span>积云和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡</span>积云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Fiona Heathcote","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国康沃尔郡Praa Sands","latitude":"纬度: 50° 9' 33'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 14' 6'' W","date":"15 November 2014 1432 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南西南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 6, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.23 1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.23 1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5650_main_altocumulus-cumulogenitus-and-cumulus-congestus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>在飞机上拍摄的这张图片中，可看到不同发展阶段的大范围<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云单体</span>。其中大多数为浓云种，有明显的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">垂直云芽</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">花椰菜状的上部</span>。垂直厚度最大的最早单体（在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>）已达到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">稳定层，云顶在此处向下风扩散</span>，形成积云性高积云。云层的上表面有典型高积云的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">轻微波纹和圆形云素</span>；没有任何结冰的证据。在右下方，云的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">弥散状</span>是高积云蒸发所致，其次是雨幡所致。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">9</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">10</span>，可看到在高积云下垂下的雨幡。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Amanda Chiu","location":"中国南海","latitude":"纬度: 22° 30' 41'' N","longitude":"经度: 118° 12' 51'' E","date":"04 September 2014 1456 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 6, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.23 2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.23 2"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4394_main_altocumulus-cumulogenitus-with-cumulus-congestus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>湖下游约20公里处的一簇<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云</span>已达到稳定层，垂直增长完全停止。可清晰观察到积云衍生高积云从母体<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云</span>顶部扩散开来。该高积云在源头附近相当厚且不透明，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">边缘</span>附近则明显变薄。右侧<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">近景</span>中的积云为新近形成，尚未达到稳定层。观测站位于冷锋过后的西南气流中，高空冷槽已向东掠过测站，西侧有弱高压脊生成。</p></div>","copyright":"© B. Colman","location":"Atlin, British Colombia, Canada","latitude":"纬度: 59° 34' 41'' N","longitude":"经度: 133° 41' 22'' W","date":"29 June 1977 1130 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南西南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 6, CH= 0","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/4462_main_altocumulus-cumulogenitus-formed-by-cumulus-congestus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc7\"><p>位于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1处</span>的浓积云顶部正延伸并扩展至<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2处</span>的高积云层中。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3处</span>的浓积云在东北方内陆区域形成良好，但尚未达到逆温层高度。附近的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>形成于海风锋面上——该锋面由南向海风与脊区弱西北气流交汇而生，云顶被高空西北气流明显带向东南方。</p></div>","copyright":"© R.K. Pilsbury","location":"Lymington, Hampshire, United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland","latitude":"纬度: 50° 45' 31'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 32' 31'' W","date":"07 September 1975 1210 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 6, CH= 0","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}